{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":201675,\"title\":\"The Wacky World of Mother Goose\",\"tagline\":\"There's A Nut On The Loose In The Land Of Mother Goose!\",\"overview\":\"In this animated children's film, Mother Goose and her fairytale friends must stop a group of sneaky spies.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hUB7R4hMujMaAzxQ1nSPDMut4p3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1NgpQQFFg3DX5rk5tORiC56TStS.jpg\",\"rating\":4.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"year\":1967,\"runtime\":81,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Jules Bass\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":16410,\"name\":\"Jules Bass\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cVyFhXXSmEWkRcJ4O62wjLBlsXF.jpg\"},{\"id\":11127,\"name\":\"Margaret Rutherford\",\"character\":\"Mother Goose (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fRoihdvOhIqFWjLPS0DCfdwmjLA.jpg\"},{\"id\":224778,\"name\":\"Bob McFadden\",\"character\":\"Humpty Dumpty/Zig Zag/Paddy Cake/Old King Cole (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k0GNLOR7oGRVprPMGtqjgXpqRqO.jpg\"},{\"id\":214820,\"name\":\"Susan Melvin\",\"character\":\"Mary Mary Quite Contrary (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1124262,\"name\":\"Bradley Bolke\",\"character\":\"Count Warptwist/Georgy Porgy/Little Dog/Brutus (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1272149,\"name\":\"Kevin Gavin\",\"character\":\"Prince Robin/Cat with a Fiddle (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1272150,\"name\":\"Laura Leslie\",\"character\":\"Princess Harmony (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1272151,\"name\":\"Bryna Raeburn\",\"character\":\"Old Mother Hubbard/Mother Goose's Sister/Patricia Pumpkin Eater (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3095644,\"name\":\"James Daugherty\",\"character\":\"Baker/Crooked Knights (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":192486,\"name\":\"Craig Sechler\",\"character\":\"Jack Horner (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1298091,\"name\":\"Robert Harter\",\"character\":\"Butcher/Crooked Knights/Town Crier (voice)\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2254667,\"name\":\"William Marine\",\"character\":\"Candlestick Maker/Crooked Knights (voice)\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":354912,\"title\":\"Coco\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6Ryitt95xrO8KXuqRGm1fUuNwqF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g7CHF8gTLGooTbP4GznIGwaqAGL.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Despite his family’s baffling generations-old ban on music, Miguel dreams of becoming an accomplished musician like his idol, Ernesto de la Cruz. Desperate to prove his talent, Miguel finds himself in the stunning and colorful Land of the Dead following a mysterious chain of events. Along the way, he meets charming trickster Hector, and together, they set off on an extraordinary journey to unlock the real story behind Miguel's family history.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508442,\"title\":\"Soul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hm58Jw4Lw8OIeECIq5qyPYhAeRJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rQaHA74pevnGsxcKGaoZVGWe9TC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":335797,\"title\":\"Sing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rwopfpHqPCYBSgBuZwkaXXqHp14.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z9ft5HYHzWcasR6SGcgeluxTznB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A koala named Buster recruits his best friend to help him drum up business for his theater by hosting a singing competition.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":446893,\"title\":\"Trolls World Tour\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7W0G3YECgDAfnuiHG91r8WqgIOe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qsxhnirlp7y4Ae9bd11oYJSX59j.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Queen Poppy and Branch make a surprising discovery — there are other Troll worlds beyond their own, and their distinct differences create big clashes between these various tribes. When a mysterious threat puts all of the Trolls across the land in danger, Poppy, Branch, and their band of friends must embark on an epic quest to create harmony among the feuding Trolls to unite them against certain doom.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":901362,\"title\":\"Trolls Band Together\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkpPTZUdq31UGDovmszsg2CchiI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDW6z7I6de6JbUgPOkAEZwKbg7G.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Branch's brother, Floyd, is kidnapped for his musical talents by a pair of nefarious pop-star villains, Branch and Poppy embark on a harrowing and emotional journey to reunite the other brothers and rescue Floyd from a fate even worse than pop-culture obscurity.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23398,\"title\":\"Alvin and the Chipmunks: The Squeakquel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2tgUeWadVJs1g6zOCZgKRs8uWC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3lf6YCItKcF3Wrrs7tp1PL0eyOT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Pop sensations Alvin, Simon and Theodore end up in the care of Dave Seville's twenty-something nephew Toby. The boys must put aside music super stardom to return to school, and are tasked with saving the school's music program by winning the $25,000 prize in a battle of the bands. But the Chipmunks unexpectedly meet their match in three singing chipmunks known as The Chipettes - Brittany, Eleanor and Jeanette. Romantic and musical sparks are ignited when the Chipmunks and Chipettes square off.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":342473,\"title\":\"Ballerina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qBxMhcmNnFniuDAZTKEHcSgKtsn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wlLdcK3Sm7zp0w1ZuVvnFlmcchM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1879 Paris, a young orphan dreams of becoming a ballerina and flees her rural Brittany for Paris, where she passes for someone else and accedes to the position of pupil at the Grand Opera house.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":454458,\"title\":\"UglyDolls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p97LQ1TL95mptVL2AS8Rz1cJCQg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/93gOZuHazBWulk7b47MCXWVTiqh.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the adorably different town of Uglyville, weirdness is celebrated, strangeness is special and beauty is embraced as more than meets the eye. After traveling to the other side of a mountain, Moxy and her UglyDoll friends discover Perfection -- a town where more conventional dolls receive training before entering the real world to find the love of a child.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Music\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":49948,\"title\":\"Fantasia 2000\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5rwAtUaKEK48CPUijVfVU0IPKPZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wBQ2tSdXgAOAdH14VgXtN9qD0Ol.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Blending lively music and brilliant animation, this sequel to the original 'Fantasia' restores 'The Sorcerer's Apprentice' and adds seven new shorts.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":808,\"title\":\"Shrek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zscUsmzDJFZjUY8f8BQqMSWlmNQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Biv1mSzaaxWOqvcnDZn4GcYEAb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It ain't easy bein' green -- especially if you're a likable (albeit smelly) ogre named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5393,\"title\":\"Happily N'Ever After\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/geXsapJfihg78gVDvEVPoK5c07y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zBW4LZyYi0Moqz82BTkEQzR7h0z.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An alliance of evil-doers, led by Frieda, looks to take over Fairy Tale Land. But when Ella realizes her stepmother is out to ruin her storybook existence, she takes a dramatic turn and blossoms into the leader of the resistance effort.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"aZ_x-mfHqHQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"IoKaeVDTWs8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"FQBGtLJksrk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}